title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Fire\" title=\"Fire\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-fire\">Fire</span></a> damage, the wearer deals an additional <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-fire\">1</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fire\" title=\"Fire\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/25px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/38px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/50px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Fire\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/25px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Fire\" title=\"Fire\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-fire\">Fire</span></a>.</dd></dl>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>     \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>This item was only obtainable in Early Access. It was rewarded by <a href=\"/wiki/Glut\" title=\"Glut\">Sovereign Glut</a> in the <a href=\"/wiki/Myconid_Colony\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Myconid Colony\">Myconid Colony</a> after helping it kill <a href=\"/wiki/Spaw\" title=\"Spaw\">Sovereign Spaw</a> during <a href=\"/wiki/Avenge_Glut%27s_Circle\" title=\"Avenge Glut's Circle\">Avenge Glut's Circle</a>. This reward was changed to <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-uncommon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Winter%27s_Clutches\" title=\"Winter's Clutches\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9b/Gloves_Leather_F_Unfaded_Icon.png/25px-Gloves_Leather_F_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/9b/Gloves_Leather_F_Unfaded_Icon.png/38px-Gloves_Leather_F_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/9b/Gloves_Leather_F_Unfaded_Icon.png/50px-Gloves_Leather_F_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9b/Gloves_Leather_F_Unfaded_Icon.png/25px-Gloves_Leather_F_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/9b/Gloves_Leather_F_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Winter%27s_Clutches\" title=\"Winter's Clutches\">Winter's Clutches</a> in the full release of the game.</li></ul>\n\n</div>  \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714202928\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.084 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.089 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2099/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 29320/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 5452/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 22/200\nExpensive parser function count: 1/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 1603/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.033/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1304209/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   76.611      1 -total\n 69.61%   53.328      1 Template:EquipmentPage\n 30.34%   23.243      1 Template:Inaccessible\n 29.84%   22.863      1 Template:Inaccessible/internal\n 28.96%   22.187      1 Template:Ambox\n 12.35%    9.463      2 Template:Uid\n 10.34%    7.919      5 Template:Icon_text\n  9.91%    7.593     22 Template:Trim\n  7.68%    5.883      2 Template:Hidden_code\n  7.38%    5.655      1 Template:PageSeo\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:3590-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714202928 and 